 lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">모니터링 결과는 지역 관광여건 개선에 반영될 예정이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">우수 모니터링팀에게는 한국관광공사 사장상 등이 부여되는 등 학생들의 관광 관련 경험을 넓힐 수 있는 기회이니 많은 참가 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대한민국 관광업그레이드 모니터링단 운영 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETT